    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Exchange conditions",
     "texto": [
      "**Bytterett** is the right to exchange a product according to the shop's conditions. In Norway, exchanging a product without a fault depends on the shop; **tilgodelapp** is a voucher to spend there, not a money refund."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
